<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>We Value Your Feedback on Projectrix</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset styles */
    body, html {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }
    
    /* Container */
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    
    /* Header */
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eaeaea;
    }
    
    /* Logo */
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap');
    
    .logo-text {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #1e3a8a, #2563eb);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
    }
    
    .logo-text::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #1e3a8a, #2563eb);
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .logo-container:hover .logo-text::after {
      width: 100%;
    }
    
    /* Content */
    .content {
      padding: 20px 0;
    }
    
    h1 {
      color: #2563eb;
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    
    .highlight {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #2563eb;
    }
    
    /* Features */
    .features {
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 15px;
      background-color: #f3f4f6;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    
    .feature {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      display: flex;
    }
    
    .feature-icon {
      flex: 0 0 30px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #2563eb;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }
    
    .feature-text {
      flex: 1;
    }
    
    /* CTA Button */
    .cta-button {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #2563eb;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: bold;
      max-width: 200px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s;
    }
    
    .cta-button:hover {
      background-color: #1d4ed8;
    }
    
    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    
    .social-links {
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    
    .social-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 0 10px;
      color: #2563eb;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    .unsubscribe {
      color: #6b7280;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <a href="https://projectrix.app" class="logo-container">
        <div class="logo-text">PROJECTRIX</div>
      </a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <h1>Thank You for Testing Projectrix, <%= name %>!</h1>
      
      <p>We sincerely appreciate you taking the time to explore our platform. Your participation during this testing phase is invaluable as we work to refine and enhance Projectrix to better serve developers and creators like you.</p>
      
      <p>We're eager to hear about your experience with our platform and would greatly value your feedback to help us improve.</p>
      
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">✨</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Have you tried all our key features?</strong> We encourage you to explore additional features including AI-powered project generation, collaborator matching, and our GitHub & Discord integrations.
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">📝</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Share your thoughts</strong>: What aspects of Projectrix worked well for you? What could be improved? Your honest feedback helps us prioritize enhancements.
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">🐛</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Encountered any issues?</strong> If you experienced any bugs, technical difficulties, or confusing workflows, we want to know so we can fix them promptly.
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">💡</div>
          <div class="feature-text">
            <strong>Suggest new features</strong>: We welcome your ideas for additional tools and capabilities that would make Projectrix more valuable to you.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p>Your feedback is crucial to our development process. Please take a moment to share your experience with us through our dedicated feedback form:</p>
      
      <a href="https://projectrix.app/feedback" class="cta-button">Share Your Feedback</a>
      
      <p>If you prefer more direct communication, you can contact us via:</p>
      
      <ul style="list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;">
        <li>📱 Phone: +234 9120888381</li>
        <li>✉️ Email: <a href="mailto:gukohgodwin@gmail.com">gukohgodwin@gmail.com</a></li>
      </ul>
      
      <p>We're committed to building a platform that truly serves the needs of our developer community, and your input is essential to achieving that goal.</p>
      
      <p>Thank you again for being an early tester of Projectrix.</p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br>The Projectrix Team</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/georgedevs" class="social-link">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://twitter.com/projectrix" class="social-link">Twitter</a>
        <a href="https://discord.gg/projectrix" class="social-link">Discord</a>
      </div>
      
      <p>You're receiving this email because you signed up for Projectrix. We'll send you occasional updates about new features and platform improvements.</p>
      
      <p>
        <a href="https://projectrix.app/unsubscribe?email=<%= userEmail %>" class="unsubscribe">Unsubscribe</a> |
        <a href="https://projectrix.app/privacy" class="unsubscribe">Privacy Policy</a>
      </p>
      
      <p>&copy; <%= year %> Projectrix. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>